    subgraph NS["namespace: aiops (all 19 workloads; the first-draft seven-namespace split was not built)"]
      E1["aiops-edge-runtime Deployment (x1 replica)\nreplays one recorded 10-minute run at 100x; non-root; its durable outbox does NOT drain to MQTT on this target (annotated in the manifest) - that path is proven on the local stack (P05.02/P05.03) and in the REC-01 lab (P12.02), not here"]
      M1["aiops-mqtt-broker StatefulSet\nPVC; ONE listener, 8883 mTLS only, client cert required (no plaintext 1883 - that is a local-dev-only fixture, ADR-0002)"]
      M2["aiops-mqtt-gateway StatefulSet\nPVC durable outbox; the only client with an ACL to read every device's topic (cert CN=gateway)"]
      IG["aiops-ingestion-gateway Deployment\nKafka to PostgreSQL, idempotent by event_id"]
      K1["aiops-kafka-broker StatefulSet\nPVC, internal only"]
      D1["aiops-postgres StatefulSet\nPVC, TLS-only (hostssl)"]
      API["aiops-api Deployment\nthe operator REST/WebSocket API - state, incidents, emergency, recommendations, commands, outcomes all served from here, backed by PostgreSQL"]
      CX["aiops-command-executor Deployment\nreconciles an orphaned `executing` command at start (D-03, P12.02); driving a real SUMO adapter needs Docker/WSL, which this pod does not have - the protected-action and adapter scenarios (P07.06-P07.10, SAFE-02) run on the local stack, not on this target"]
      OV["aiops-outcome-verifier Deployment\nindependent pre/post-window verification, rollback/escalate"]
      SC["aiops-scenario-control Deployment\nseparate identity; structurally no path to command/v1 or an adapter"]
      PC["aiops-platform-correlator Deployment\nplatform-signal correlation into platform incidents (P10.07), reads Prometheus"]
      PP["aiops-platform-probe Deployment\nthe gauges the P10.04 alert rules fire on"]
      FE["aiops-frontend Deployment\noperator console"]
      KC["aiops-keycloak StatefulSet\nPVC, realm import"]
      OPA["aiops-opa Deployment\npolicy bundle"]
      PR["aiops-prometheus StatefulSet\nPVC, bounded retention"]
      TE["aiops-tempo StatefulSet\nPVC"]
      LO["aiops-loki StatefulSet\nPVC"]
      GR["aiops-grafana StatefulSet\nPVC"]
    end
